# Lesson1.BankAccount

This project demonstrates encapsulation and property usage in C# through a simple `BankAccount` class.

## Features

- `OwnerName`: public auto-property
- `Balance`: read-only property backed by a private field
- `Deposit(amount)`: adds funds with validation
- `Withdraw(amount)`: subtracts funds with validation and error handling

## Example

```csharp
var account = new BankAccount("Alice", 1000m);
account.Deposit(250m);
account.Withdraw(100m);
Console.WriteLine(account.Balance); // 1150
